<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42294" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sălăpĭa</span></b> ,
		ae (also contr. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sălpia</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Vitr. 1, 4 <i>fin.</i></span></i>;
		cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαλπία,</span>
		<i><span class="en">App. B. Civ. 1, 52</span></i>), f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city in Daunian
				Apulia</i>, now <i>Salpi</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 11,
				16, § 103</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 24,
			20</span></i>; <i><span class="en">27,
			28</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sălăpīnus</span></b> , a,
			um (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sălpīnus</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Luc. 5,
			377</span></i> Cort. <i>N. cr.</i>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sălpīni</span></b> ,
				<i><span class="en">Vitr. 1,
				4 <i>fin.</i></span></i>), adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			Salapia</i>, <i>Salapian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					5, 377</span></i>
			.—In plur.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sălăpīni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Salapia</i>, <i>the
			Salapians</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Agr. 2, 27, 71</span></i>.
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sălăpĭtāni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., = Salapini, <i>the inhabitants of Salapia</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 27,
			28</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
